                "comment": "This was my first experience with a creative writing course, but this prof made it so enjoyable. Definitely take a class with Kay if you have the chance. Every week a couple people's short story or poems are critiqued in an open discussion, and overall you will be scored on how hard you try and how much you show you improve over the semester",
